        ],
        "text": "Mr. Crane is a person who has been found legally responsible, is competent to stand trial, is imprisoned, and upon release would be subject to involuntary commitment for a mental disorder."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1665b5fc5b3512251c1de816ba66626b3ee00ccaedae5fe2e5c07831187413f3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-1665b5fc5b35-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice, qUESTION: What does the court have to find in order to release a person under the statute?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice (unspecified)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1665b5fc5b3512251c1de816ba66626b3ee00ccaedae5fe2e5c07831187413f3",
