          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice asked whether the reference to a volitionally impaired person in *Hendricks* was descriptive rather than essential to the holding."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1665b5fc5b3512251c1de816ba66626b3ee00ccaedae5fe2e5c07831187413f3",
